 SG_ Cy : 48|16@1+ (0.1,0) [0|6553.5] "px" CANOE

BO_ 865 CALIB_B: 8 CAM_PC
 SG_ NClasses : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" CANOE
 SG_ ConfThresholdPct : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "%" CANOE

